{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, move to object, pick it up and check properties. Scan area for objects, then do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
